# Production build config, read by `vite build` (Cloudflare Pages).
# Committed on purpose: an OAuth *client ID* is public by design — it ships
# inside the JS bundle either way. Only client SECRETS must stay out of git
# (this Google sign-in flow uses none in the frontend).
# A VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID set in the Pages build environment would override this.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=278448263169-0eu1cf10vdo05ovutdql62t32kb9136a.apps.googleusercontent.com
